ng","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" Ahasuerus","strong":"H325"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Esther","strong":"H635"},{"text":" the queen","strong":"H4436"},{"text":" and to Mordecai","strong":"H4782"},{"text":" the Jew","strong":"H3064"},{"text":", Behold, I have given","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" Esther","strong":"H635"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of Haman","strong":"H2001"},{"text":", and him they have hanged","strong":"H8518"},{"text":" upon the gallows","strong":"H6086"},{"text":", because he laid","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" his hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" upon the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12825,"title":"Esther 8:8","segments":["Write ye also for the Jews, as it liketh you, in the king's name, and seal [it] with the king's ring: for the writing which is written in the king's name, and sealed with the king's ring, may no man reverse."],"ref":"Esther 8:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"Write","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" ye also for the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":", as it liketh","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" you","strong":"H5869"},{"text":", in the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":", and seal","strong":"H2856"},{"text":" [it] with the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" ring","strong":"H2885"},{"text":": for the writing","strong":"H3791"},{"text":" which is written","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" in the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":", and sealed","strong":"H2856"},{"text":" with the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" ring","strong":"H2885"},{"text":", may no man reverse","strong":"H7725"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12826,"title":"Esther 8:9","segments":["Then were the king's scribes called at that time in the third month, that [is], the month Sivan, on the three and twentieth [day] thereof; and it was written according to all that Mordecai commanded unto the Jews, and to the lieutenants, and the deputies and rulers of the provinces which [are] from India unto Ethiopia, an hundred twenty and seven provinces, unto every province according to the writing thereof, and unto every people after their language, and to the Jews according to their writing, and according to their language."],"ref":"Esther 8:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"Then were the king's","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" scribes","strong":"H5608"},{"text":" called","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" at that time","strong":"H6256"},{"text":" in the third","strong":"H7992"},{"text":" month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":", that [is], the month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":" Sivan","strong":"H5510"},{"text":", on the three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" and twentieth","strong":"H6242"},{"text":" [day] thereof; and it was written","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" according to all that Mordecai","strong":"H4782"},{"text":" commanded","strong":"H6680"},{"text":" unto the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":", and to the lieutenants","strong":"H323"},{"text":", and the deputies","strong":"H6346"},{"text":" and rulers","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of the provinces","strong":"H4082"},{"text":" which [are] from India","strong":"H1912"},{"text":" unto Ethiopia","strong":"H3568"},{"text":", an hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" twenty","strong":"H6242"},{"text":" and seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" provinces","strong":"H4082"},{"text":", unto every province","strong":"H4082"},{"text":" according to the writing","strong":"H3791"},{"text":" thereof, and unto every people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" after their language","strong":"H3956"},{"text":", and to the Jews","strong":"H3064"},{"text":" according to their writing","strong":"H3791"},{"text":", and according to their language","strong":"H3956"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12827,"title":"Esther 8:10","segments":["And he wrote in the king Ahasuerus' name, and sealed [it] with the king's ring, and sent letters by posts on horseback, [and] riders on mules, camels, [and] young dromedaries:"],"ref":"Esther 8:10","verse":10,"words":[